Official Alpine Linux Docker image project
https://github.com/alpinelinux/docker-alpine

Shomsky Linux container images are built FROM the official Alpine Linux
Docker Hub image (alpine:<version>), which is maintained by the Alpine
Linux project via docker-alpine.

